# Checkpoint 1 & 2: Middleware (Request ID)
# http
# ### 1. Check Headers (Should have an x-request-id)
# GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders

# ### 2. Honour a Client ID (Should return x-request-id: me-123)
# GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders
# x-request-id: me-123

# ### 3. Trace the Error (Should return requestId: trace-me-404 in JSON)
# curl -i -H "x-request-id: trace-me-404" http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/99999

# Checkpoint 3: Guards (The Bouncer)
# http
# ### 4. No API Key (Should be 401 Unauthorized)
# DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1

# ### 5. Wrong API Key (Should be 403 Forbidden)
# DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1
# x-api-key: totally-wrong-key

# ### 6. Correct API Key (Should be 204 No Content)
# DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1
# x-api-key: super-secret-key



# GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders


# curl -X DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/orders/1 -H "x-api-key: super-secret-key"



